{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0c93d16ffc6c42fa8cf73a911418a0b992c8f7b8034f7383dba3350375d9c919","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d9e1fc8dc423969150ad123c55d0b46fcdb24ee6754188a98df5c9cda93abb16","slc_f2af8a609472cf88baeda06d226a58a9f3c5b85e03972222aff1f14fa814558b"],"source_ids":["src_8da6221407295cef9e079f0870952adf"],"text":"Default supervision policy auto-approves only repo-scoped command_exec and file_write dialogs; network, credential, deletion, push, install, device, and unknown classes default to hold, and nothing auto-denies out of the box.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0d9583528c0eb2effcd94126de2120503c10542ba6e69be3ffcbfa9117777403","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6f0ec843015ee052662b3f7dc32d4560a4a35af644b069c57b651fb1f738c3b6"],"source_ids":["src_8da6221407295cef9e079f0870952adf"],"text":"A hardcoded always-escalate veto (force pushes, rm -rf-shaped deletions, git reset --hard, git clean -f, sudo rm) overrides any policy, including explicit auto_approve mappings and learned rules.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_177b77535d127cf3546e9461131a733a6e2fa39035738e7c5ffbfcd8fa510a30","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6a993c1e974ad62771d76a5d826585366e92e7bee8aa1aaab8f314a74dacb436","slc_dc4e18ccff5df5217440e23910bb549b25d24c1709365bf0635fd6f01cb82aed"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8"],"text":"The standalone CLI requires Git on every platform and tmux on macOS/Linux; Windows uses a bundled ConPTY host, and the desktop app bundles the daemon, CLI/TUI, and portable tmux so no separate installs are needed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_441fa662b21ce733bb38dd8462d6e533adc012ee6712f76cff3829b152b497a3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7ba7213e953c254827c95f0db0463669e4b80d1f2b513875ed10e7ba5cb7d7fe","slc_f4de902af4aec4f2083e0bbc4d64c61f5d5ecb72ffc1e1a53ce80182b9575c64"],"source_ids":["src_8da6221407295cef9e079f0870952adf"],"text":"supervision.set is deliberately excluded from the remote WebSocket bridge allowlist, so granting auto-approval authority is a local-only decision; agents' MCP tools are read-only with no approval power.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_524e24a6a7b7d98405dabc6ab3a2d14fb0045269972a724e5472e6790557475e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a1b8b194ff1853d4f2deeb0fe31fc021aed204305b8f3000cff261b8e6e3df75"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8"],"text":"A background daemon, repomond, owns SQLite, file watchers, the git layer, and the agent runtime, exposing a JSON-RPC API over a Unix socket or Windows named pipe; desktop, TUI, and iOS clients are thin clients over that API.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6cb0005c4f3bbe77e2cb89d994ccb59743ee7f108488d2f602832152233747f1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3307eb12bc40f9dc2b358f679b87542b867ab25e36f0d1d7b46038971d45ba88","slc_5f2f36f72b8e5fd6f743ba523c8bf4e4704e3267efb25a77129ae4b6fe238e50"],"source_ids":["src_8da6221407295cef9e079f0870952adf"],"text":"Supervision is off by default globally and per lane; enabling requires both the master switch in config.toml and an enabled lane policy, with the master switch overriding every lane.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_751e7923e7d7a16bb7c90fcc6b8379a8f3727d3fc9858473ad04b462fbe64e49","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_aad8900d704e42523fa87996c046fe911dc89c57e9d5fd14e5c1d4903c2cbcbf"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8"],"text":"Repomon writes its own SQLite database in a platform data directory (overridable via REPOMON_DATA_DIR) and a Repomind home normally at ~/repomind when that feature is enabled.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_78b2b6d9b8a8efa983299bf38d8bb084ae8a4e965e51d873644bb78627038d42","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5273d355b61ef3699c36ecd3ff745247ab2c8bdf7c38057b6f3fa1e946e4dcc7"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8"],"text":"Repository development practice: the README's development section instructs contributors to run `cargo test --workspace` for Rust and `bun install && bun run test` in apps/desktop for the frontend.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8903dba059f744044a80f0807bb1fb45139ed91524474b83883b5f644e2b322f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_45b651e38e5e8e6c5a3545c91f2fc3ec1a0ff9bf9addd378d8bb6aa0dd99bcbc","slc_697cac8e007f2bbd4acb105a64d397dbdc46a7fc53c125eadb49686f1d7eb026","slc_bdc5a0e3d5ef3b37160b5900fd24e3a83f7be6c3319f1fa2d7cd09cae6e69b16"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8","src_cef8fc477a675802a3bd5cf19cefeaee"],"text":"Agents run in durable session windows: tmux windows on macOS/Linux, or a per-window detached repomon-agent-host.exe ConPTY process on Windows; because the session backend owns the process, agents survive daemon and TUI restarts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_95053e1125715e34605a2c8e58ce8c0483e90e29a7b70e1ba5280aadf078fed3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_51aa7267167eb987a73a49c587c5a5b5bdf36f0f78ed3d032ce3c3a58cd634ac","slc_63249dda75c6c5620e0c01f142ddfe1e0c01c19f2e4ec9c11921a940fa1049a9","slc_cd0df9975b3ef0f62a58d0d4ce5429b12495ff2bacc647aaf32d72bce03e83d7"],"source_ids":["src_8da6221407295cef9e079f0870952adf"],"text":"Every supervision action or skipped action writes exactly one row to a durable supervision_log SQLite table recording trigger, decision, keys sent, outcome, and pane excerpt.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bbc6ea2fa91e6b90bdd70dd3b8b41d2cf8944fc73499770c312450d8921cfdd9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9ac2680bebd3d9b7e870bf6fcb26121ae567d819a7e83898ae5196d52c3df01a","slc_bd62d9a28af00ebd9977448ea2ddba7b5e2b1323014026b004bebff9c703d4ed"],"source_ids":["src_8da6221407295cef9e079f0870952adf"],"text":"Supervision methods live under a `supervision.*` JSON-RPC namespace (get, set, audit, status, nudge) on the local daemon socket.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c1c2cde733d9b5b5d8c24084ed815352b39a5a007fc47e97f0b95cf0f5b3cdbe","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8cf5d06a354bfa68590e5e85ad4d6e29f468426d8b11eb4e073612cffc7aa59c","slc_bb7d7ab592a7aad3ae7d4e5692653a0fb23411b71fc817be2a2229a404b3f47a"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8"],"text":"The daemon exposes a JSON-RPC API documented for writing custom clients, plus an MCP server (`repomond mcp`) that exposes the fleet to agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dda6addfa466aaeaaf3f2016eac0db62456bb0267af458fbdc3a84f201acf740","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bb7d7ab592a7aad3ae7d4e5692653a0fb23411b71fc817be2a2229a404b3f47a"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8"],"text":"The workspace is split into crates: repomon-core (data model, gix git layer, SQLite store, watchers, usage ledger, agent runtime), repomon-daemon, repomon-tui, repomon-mcp, repomon-host, and a Tauri desktop app.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dfe945c83df1f7dd6c9ad4a4764524f027fea138b908f0dc7cbb9c15afa9e326","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"alihamzaazam/repomon@e655d18f83d8 snapshot 8834abe468e940fd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_697cac8e007f2bbd4acb105a64d397dbdc46a7fc53c125eadb49686f1d7eb026"],"source_ids":["src_c8e1d0730b045399aef99596046a2af8"],"text":"Live agent processes survive app and daemon restarts but not an OS reboot; current desktop downloads lack an OS-level code signature, and the iOS companion is built but not yet released.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4324eae9f158481bbd0a14c9d6f586c8"}
